\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Standard Bots has officially achieved unicorn status, securing $200 million in a Series C funding round co-led by General Catalyst and RoboStrategy. This investment values the New York-based robotics company at $1 billion. As industry leaders increasingly recognize the pivotal role of automation in manufacturing, Standard Bots is poised to leverage artificial intelligence to bridge the gap between U.S. production capabilities and global competitors. The funding announcement was made on 10th June 2026.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Founded in 2011 by Evan Beard, who previously co-founded A Plus and Gridtech, Standard Bots has grown significantly since David Golden joined as co-founder in 2020. Golden, known for his role in establishing Bowery Farming and LeapPay, has contributed to the company\u8217 s innovative approach to robotics. Standard Bots aims to make industrial robots more accessible by focusing on ease of use and affordability, addressing the challenges that have traditionally hindered manufacturers' adoption of automation.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Standard Bots' AI-native robotic arms differentiate themselves by learning through demonstration rather than traditional programming. This unique capability allows operators to teach robots tasks directly, significantly reducing deployment time and costs. The company claims its robots can be deployed across various applications, including machining, welding, and assembly, at approximately 30% lower costs compared to legacy providers. Notable customers include Amazon, Lockheed Martin, NASA, and the U.S. Army, alongside numerous small and medium-sized manufacturers.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 The company\u8217 s vertically integrated model sets it apart from competitors. Standard Bots designs its own actuators and assembles products in-house, with plans to manufacture nearly all components domestically by 2027. This strategy not only streamlines production but also aligns with broader efforts to revitalize American manufacturing capabilities. Beard has emerged as a key advocate for this cause, advising policymakers and speaking before congressional committees on the importance of industrial efficiency and technological advancement.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 The recent funding will enable Standard Bots to expand its manufacturing facility in Glen Cove to 70,000 square feet and accelerate its goal of capturing 10% of new U.S. industrial robot deployments within the year. However, significant challenges remain. The company must compete against well-established domestic suppliers and address the rapid pace at which China is installing industrial robots. As Standard Bots continues to innovate and scale, its ability to meet these challenges will be critical to its future success in the evolving landscape of automation.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
