\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Lightspeed Venture Partners is set to bolster its marketing leadership team with the appointment of Rohit Kaul as the new marketing head. This development comes as the firm prepares to raise its fifth India and Southeast Asia-focused fund, reportedly targeting around $500 million. The hiring of Kaul follows the recent exit of former VP of Marketing and Communications, Mansi Chugh, who departed after nearly four years in her role.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Rohit Kaul was previously the Vice President of Marketing at Blume Ventures, a position he held since February 2023. His experience also includes pivotal roles at Sacra and HCL, providing him with a robust background that Lightspeed believes will enhance its marketing strategy. The appointment comes at a pivotal moment for Lightspeed as the venture capital firm intensifies its investment focus in the Indian and Southeast Asian markets, which are currently facing a slowdown in startup funding and pressure on portfolio performance.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 In recent years, Lightspeed has established itself as one of the most prominent investors in India's startup ecosystem, backing notable companies such as OYO, Udaan, ShareChat, PhysicsWallah, and Pocket FM. The firm\u8217 s proactive approach to securing talent is evident, especially in light of multiple senior-level changes within its communications and marketing functions. Previously, Carina Chopra stepped down after a three-and-a-half-year tenure, signaling a shift in the firm's marketing strategy.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 The strategic hire of Rohit Kaul is aimed at navigating the current challenges in the startup landscape while enhancing Lightspeed's brand presence and outreach. As the firm looks to bolster its marketing efforts, Kaul\u8217 s extensive experience in the venture capital space is expected to play a crucial role in driving forward Lightspeed's initiatives in India and Southeast Asia.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 While queries directed to both Kaul and Lightspeed Venture Partners did not elicit responses prior to publication, the firm\u8217 s ongoing recruitment efforts suggest a commitment to strengthening its operational frameworks. As Lightspeed prepares for its upcoming fundraising endeavors, the addition of Kaul to its leadership team may enhance its competitive edge in an increasingly challenging investment environment.}
